            "review_title": "Review at Hinode Deli Sushi",
            "review_text": "Shin Ramen and Sushi\n7 contributions\n0\nGreat, will come back\nDec 2023 • Family\nHinode is always my first choice when craving Japanese food. I have been a loyal customer of the restaurant for 3 years because of the fresh and delicious food, very cheap prices compared to quality and service, friendly staff and variety of dishes.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 8, 2023",
